{ Exercise. Try the questions in the book before reading this line. } 1... Rxc1# { Illustrative line. White's h-pawn is now on h2. The king cannot move onto its own pawn, so the h2 escape from Model A has disappeared. ...Rxc1# is immediate checkmate. The rook checks along the first rank, White cannot capture or block, and the king has no safe destination. There is no next move: the game has ended. Capturing the knight is irrelevant. A good calculation reports the earliest decisive result rather than automatically completing a memorized sequence. } 0-1
